 ('rebellious_son_seized_commanded', 'status', "the rebellious son's seizing commanded — the STATUS the line rebellious_son_declared writes on Israel: 'HIS FATHER AND HIS MOTHER SHALL SEIZE HIM AND BRING HIM OUT TO THE ELDERS OF HIS CITY and to the gate of his place' (21:19) — both willing and able, the five abilities from the five verbs, three then twenty-three (Mishnah Sanhedrin 8:4 — the exam row); a son not a daughter, the window (8:1); the theft's condition (8:3); the parents' pardon (the Sifrei 218:1-11, 219:1-4); Onkelos 'the gate of the court of his place'", H['seize'] + " (his father and his mother shall seize him and bring him out to the elders of his city — Deut 21:19)", "Deut 21:18-20, 16:18 (festivals_judges by CALL); Onkelos 21:18-20; the Sifrei on Deuteronomy 218:1-11, 219:1-4", CORPUS, EX % ("F8 the_rebellious_son — a_son_not_a_daughter, stubborn_and_rebellious_judged_by_his_end, they_chastise_him_and_he_hears_not, his_father_and_his_mother_seize_him", "rebellious_son_declared")),
 ('rebellious_son_stoning_commanded', 'status', "the rebellious son's stoning commanded — the STATUS the line rebellious_son_declared writes on Israel: 'AND ALL THE MEN OF HIS CITY SHALL STONE HIM WITH STONES AND HE SHALL DIE; and you shall purge the evil from your midst, and all Israel shall hear and fear' (21:21) — a tartemar of meat and half a log of wine (Mishnah Sanhedrin 8:2 — the exam row; Onkelos 'a glutton of meat and a drinker of wine'); the city's men a presence, stones then a stone (mekoshesh and seducers by CALL); the purge formula's fifth seat as persons; hear-and-fear's fourth and last (the Sifrei 220:1-4, 221:1)", H['stone'] + " (and all the men of his city shall stone him with stones and he shall die — Deut 21:21)", "Deut 21:20-21, 13:11-12 (seducers by CALL), 17:7 (courts_prophet by CALL), Numbers 15:35-36 (mekoshesh by CALL), Proverbs 23:20; Onkelos 21:20-21; the Sifrei on Deuteronomy 220:1-4, 221:1", CORPUS, EX % ("F8 the_rebellious_son — a_glutton_and_a_drunkard, all_the_men_of_his_city_stone_him", "rebellious_son_declared")),
